        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571730/extras/12db80c91dff726a45c95a90e0cc1f69.avif?t=1786980588\" width=1152 height=384 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Switch between an alchemist and a flying golem hand in an instant. </strong><br><strong>Fight, dodge, solve puzzles, and uncover hidden routes by using two bodies as one.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571730/extras/1e88207e0397c5b04e26751168c06b58.avif?t=1786980588\" width=544 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571730/extras/c906877c0f1aba98cd155787bd05b648.poster.avif?t=1786980588\" width=1440 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571730/extras/c906877c0f1aba98cd155787bd05b648.webm?t=1786980588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571730/extras/c906877c0f1aba98cd155787bd05b648.mp4?t=1786980588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Switch characters to outsmart the golems.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mercouri runs across the ground, while Hando flies through the air. <br>But neither of them is perfect. <br>Short Mercouri can’t reach high places, and golem Hando can’t pick up items or interact with objects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By switching between the two characters, they can compensate for each other’s weaknesses. <br>Hando helps Mercouri reach higher places, and aerial enemies can be tackled by Hando.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerful foes must be lured and defeated through clever character switching.  <br>Solve puzzles that one character alone cannot, and win battles by outsmarting the golems!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571730/extras/e0f73b7f5c914f3c67bf14fccc307808.avif?t=1786980588\" width=544 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571730/extras/a4460b7bf8e0d98d9c47635f639e7bad.poster.avif?t=1786980588\" width=1440 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571730/extras/a4460b7bf8e0d98d9c47635f639e7bad.webm?t=1786980588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571730/extras/a4460b7bf8e0d98d9c47635f639e7bad.mp4?t=1786980588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The girl and the golem fall into the golem kingdom of [Sophiatica].</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The kingdom of [Sophiatica], once built by alchemists, has now fallen into ruin.<br>Now, it is a den of masterless golems roaming without purpose.<br>Mercouri, a girl wielding a book, and Hando, a hand-shaped golem, have fallen into this kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To revive their friend Hadel, they embark on a journey to find his soul, the Pangenium.<br>The Pangenium has shattered into eight pieces and scattered across the kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Setting foot in Sophiatica, Mercouri and Hando move forward together, helping one another. <br>What secrets and trials await them?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571730/extras/00123976c62160ac08a095a39554913c.avif?t=1786980588\" width=544 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571730/extras/9f0937770465e3fb65c25ed386f512bd.poster.avif?t=1786980588\" width=1440 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571730/extras/9f0937770465e3fb65c25ed386f512bd.webm?t=1786980588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571730/extras/9f0937770465e3fb65c25ed386f512bd.mp4?t=1786980588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hidden paths, the kingdom of eight hues, and the NPCs</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sophiatica is a kingdom composed of uniquely themed areas—<br>from underground waterways, blazing hot mining zones, to the climate gardens above the clouds.<br>Each area hides secret paths, items, and mechanics.<br>With a bit of attention, you’ll uncover the kingdom’s subtle secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This vast and interconnected kingdom is also home to NPCs with their own stories.<br>As Mercouri and Hando go on their adventure, so too do the inhabitants continue their own journeys. </p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571730/extras/12db80c91dff726a45c95a90e0cc1f69.avif?t=1786980588\" width=1152 height=384 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Switch between an alchemist and a flying golem hand in an instant. </strong><br><strong>Fight, dodge, solve puzzles, and uncover hidden routes by using two bodies as one.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571730/extras/1e88207e0397c5b04e26751168c06b58.avif?t=1786980588\" width=544 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571730/extras/c906877c0f1aba98cd155787bd05b648.poster.avif?t=1786980588\" width=1440 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571730/extras/c906877c0f1aba98cd155787bd05b648.webm?t=1786980588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571730/extras/c906877c0f1aba98cd155787bd05b648.mp4?t=1786980588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Switch characters to outsmart the golems.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mercouri runs across the ground, while Hando flies through the air. <br>But neither of them is perfect. <br>Short Mercouri can’t reach high places, and golem Hando can’t pick up items or interact with objects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By switching between the two characters, they can compensate for each other’s weaknesses. <br>Hando helps Mercouri reach higher places, and aerial enemies can be tackled by Hando.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerful foes must be lured and defeated through clever character switching.  <br>Solve puzzles that one character alone cannot, and win battles by outsmarting the golems!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571730/extras/e0f73b7f5c914f3c67bf14fccc307808.avif?t=1786980588\" width=544 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571730/extras/a4460b7bf8e0d98d9c47635f639e7bad.poster.avif?t=1786980588\" width=1440 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571730/extras/a4460b7bf8e0d98d9c47635f639e7bad.webm?t=1786980588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571730/extras/a4460b7bf8e0d98d9c47635f639e7bad.mp4?t=1786980588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The girl and the golem fall into the golem kingdom of [Sophiatica].</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The kingdom of [Sophiatica], once built by alchemists, has now fallen into ruin.<br>Now, it is a den of masterless golems roaming without purpose.<br>Mercouri, a girl wielding a book, and Hando, a hand-shaped golem, have fallen into this kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To revive their friend Hadel, they embark on a journey to find his soul, the Pangenium.<br>The Pangenium has shattered into eight pieces and scattered across the kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Setting foot in Sophiatica, Mercouri and Hando move forward together, helping one another. <br>What secrets and trials await them?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571730/extras/00123976c62160ac08a095a39554913c.avif?t=1786980588\" width=544 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571730/extras/9f0937770465e3fb65c25ed386f512bd.poster.avif?t=1786980588\" width=1440 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571730/extras/9f0937770465e3fb65c25ed386f512bd.webm?t=1786980588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571730/extras/9f0937770465e3fb65c25ed386f512bd.mp4?t=1786980588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hidden paths, the kingdom of eight hues, and the NPCs</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sophiatica is a kingdom composed of uniquely themed areas—<br>from underground waterways, blazing hot mining zones, to the climate gardens above the clouds.<br>Each area hides secret paths, items, and mechanics.<br>With a bit of attention, you’ll uncover the kingdom’s subtle secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This vast and interconnected kingdom is also home to NPCs with their own stories.<br>As Mercouri and Hando go on their adventure, so too do the inhabitants continue their own journeys. </p>",
